### Register Admin #1
POST {{host}}{{admin_mapping}}{{register_admin_mapping}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{admin_1_email}}",
    "password": "{{password}}",
    "firstname": "John",
    "lastname": "Doe"
}

### Authorize Admin #1
POST {{host}}{{authentication_mapping}}{{authorize_staff_admin_mapping}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "{{admin_1_email}}",
    "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Register Staff #1
POST {{host}}{{admin_mapping}}{{register_staff_mapping}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_auth_token}}

{
    "username": "{{staff_1_email}}",
    "password": "{{password}}",
    "firstname": "Robert",
    "lastname": "Lewandowski"
}

